The Cortex XDR agent's Windows Event Log collection is not a full channel forward. It is a curated list: a handful of Operational channels in full, plus a fixed subset of event IDs from Security, System and Application
Query used to pull the cortex agent baseline:
dataset = microsoft_windows_raw
| filter _collector_type = "Cortex Agent"
| alter log = coalesce(channel, "(operational)")
| comp count() as events, count_distinct(host_name) as hosts, min(log_level) as level_min, max(log_level) as level_max, max(_time) as last_seen by log, provider_name, event_id
| sort asc provider_name, asc event_id

